---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Advertise With Us" description="Advertise with Rozgar Raasta Pakistan — reach Pakistani job seekers, students and freelancers with clearly labelled, honest advertising.">
	<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl">Advertise With Us</h1>
		<div class="prose-rrp mt-6">
			<p>Rozgar Raasta Pakistan reaches Pakistani job seekers, students, fresh graduates and freelancers — people actively looking for real opportunities. If your product or service genuinely helps them, we would like to hear from you.</p>
			<h2>What we offer</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Clearly labelled display advertising on article and category pages.</li>
				<li>Sponsored listings for genuine courses, training programmes and career services — clearly marked as sponsored.</li>
				<li>Sponsored guides, written to the same editorial standard as our own content and labelled as sponsored.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>What we do not accept</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Ads for fake jobs, "guaranteed income" schemes, or anything that asks readers to pay for a job.</li>
				<li>Misleading claims, fake testimonials or hidden advertising.</li>
				<li>Ads that imitate government logos or imply official endorsement.</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>Transparency</h2>
			<p>All paid content is labelled. Advertisers never influence our editorial content or our verification of opportunities. See our <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.</p>
			<h2>Enquire</h2>
			<p>To discuss advertising, <a href="/contact">contact us</a> and choose "Advertising enquiry". Please describe your product or service and who it helps.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
